This data dictionary provides a description of the fields contained in the **Hive Tech IT Support dataset**, including their purpose and role within the analysis.

| Field             | Description                                                                   |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Ticket ID         | Unique identifier assigned to each support ticket.                            |
| Date              | Date the ticket was created.                                                  |
| Resolution Date   | Calculated expected resolution date for the ticket.                           |
| Subject           | Subject line summarizing the support request or issue.                        |
| Body              | Main body of the client's support request or issue description.               |
| Answer            | Support response or follow-up provided by the support team.                   |
| Type              | Type of support request or issue, such as Request or Problem.                 |
| Queue             | Support queue responsible for handling the ticket.                            |
| Priority          | Priority level assigned to the ticket.                                        |
| Primary Tag       | Primary classification assigned to the ticket.                                |
| Secondary Tag     | Secondary classification providing additional context.                        |
| Category Tag      | General category used to classify the ticket.                                 |
| Technical Tag     | Specific technical classification associated with the ticket.                 |
| Status Tag        | Status or nature of the issue.                                                |
| Resolution Tag    | Classification describing the resolution associated with the ticket.          |
| Documentation Tag | Documentation-related classification or reference associated with the ticket. |
| Additional Tag    | Additional contextual classification or tagging information.                  |
| Country           | Country from which the ticket originated.                                     |
| Latitude          | Latitude coordinate of the ticket's originating location.                     |
| Longitude         | Longitude coordinate of the ticket's originating location.                    |
